{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34443","headline":"寒夜文宴得惊字 · 陆龟蒙","name":"寒夜文宴得惊字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"各将寒调触诗情，旋见微澌入砚生。\n霜月满庭人暂起，汀洲半夜雁初惊。\n三秋每爲仙题想，一日多因累句倾。\n千里建康衰草外，含毫谁是忆昭明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}